  "post_title": "La actividad 'Sotabalcons' de Onda se traslada al Museu del Taulell",
  "post_date": "2013-05-08 08:00:48",
  "post_name": "la-actividad-sotabalcons-de-onda-se-traslada-al-museu-del-taulell",
